tyle={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>验证门禁</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 76, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>执行记录</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 76, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>CI</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 12}}>模型之外的一切，都是 harness。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", marginTop: 6}}>这一页只定义，不展开——展开留给下一幕。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>08 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
